dence interval.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote8"><label/><p>Mean IGF-I and mean IFGBP-3 are means of hormone levels, expressed in ng/ml, for subjects (cases&#x0002b;controls) belonging to each genotype category, adjusted for age and centre.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote9"><label>d</label><p>Internal references are used for polymorphisms not present in dbSNP.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote10"><label/><p><italic>P</italic>-values that reached statistical significance at the 0.05 level are reported in bold.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>